        "custom_liquid": "<!-- ============================================\n     NUR PROTOCOL — ABOUT / FOUNDER PAGE (v3)\n     Hero: full-width centered text, as before.\n     Recognized: two stacked rows, each its OWN image tightly paired\n     with its OWN caption (image left, text right) — no ambiguity\n     about which photo illustrates which credential, and no empty\n     space since each image fills its box via object-fit:cover.\n     The award row uses a smaller media column on purpose (visual\n     hierarchy: primary credential bigger, supporting proof smaller),\n     which also keeps the engraved plaque naturally too small to\n     read, without any blur.\n     Facts: first name only (\"Myriam\"), no surname anywhere.\n     ============================================ -->\n\n<style>\n  .nur-about {\n    font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\n    background-color: #FAFAF8;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Hero ---------- */\n  .nur-about__hero {\n    max-width: 780px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    text-align: center;\n    padding: 110px 40px 32px;\n  }\n\n  .nur-about__eyebrow {\n    display: inline-block;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    letter-spacing: 4px;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: #C8A96E;\n    margin-bottom: 20px;\n  }\n\n  .nur-about__origin {\n    display: block;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    letter-spacing: 2.5px;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: #A8A096;\n    margin: -12px 0 20px;\n  }\n\n  .nur-about__title {\n    font-size: clamp(28px, 3.8vw, 46px);\n    font-weight: 300;\n    line-height: 1.18;\n    color: #1A1A1A;\n    margin: 0 0 28px;\n    letter-spacing: -0.5px;\n  }\n\n  .nur-about__title em {\n    font-style: italic;\n    color: #C8A96E;\n  }\n\n  .nur-about__lead {\n    font-size: 15.5px;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    line-height: 1.8;\n    color: #5A5A5A;\n    text-align: left;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    max-width: 580px;\n  }\n\n  .nur-about__lead + .nur-about__lead {\n    margin-top: 18px;\n  }\n\n  .nur-about__lead strong {\n    color: #1A1A1A;\n    font-weight: 600;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Closing CTA ---------- */\n  .nur-about__cta {\n    padding: 0 40px 110px;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n\n  .nur-about__cta-title {\n    font-size: clamp(24px, 3vw, 32px);\n    font-weight: 300;\n    line-height: 1.2;\n    color: #1A1A1A;\n    margin: 0 0 28px;\n    letter-spacing: -0.4px;\n    max-width: 520px;\n    margin-left: auto;\n    margin-right: auto;\n  }\n\n  .nur-about__cta-title em {\n    font-style: italic;\n    color: #C8A96E;\n  }\n\n  .nur-about__cta-link {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 8px;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    color: #FFFFFF;\n    background: #1A1A1A;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    border: 1.5px solid #1A1A1A;\n    padding: 13px 28px;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    transition: background 0.3s ease, color 0.3s ease, gap 0.3s ease;\n  }\n\n  .nur-about__cta-link:hover {\n    background: transparent;\n    color: #1A1A1A;\n    gap: 11px;\n  }\n\n  @media (max-width: 640px) {\n    .nur-about__hero { padding: 64px 20px 24px; }\n    .nur-about__cta { padding: 0 20px 72px; }\n  }\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"nur-about\">\n\n  <section class=\"nur-about__hero\">\n    <span class=\"nur-about__eyebrow\">The Founder</span>\n    <span class=\"nur-about__origin\">Dubai &middot; Paris</span>\n    <h1 class=\"nur-about__title\">I spent two years helping brands sell to you<br><em>Now I'm building for you</em></h1>\n    <p class=\"nur-about__lead\">For two years, through <strong>cAIre Solutions</strong>, I built the AI agents behind some of the most advanced experiences in luxury beauty, for brands, esthetic clinics and skincare companies who wanted to understand their customers better.</p>\n    <p class=\"nur-about__lead\">And on every single project, I ran into the same wall. The brand had the data. The AI had the answers. But you, standing in front of your mirror, overwhelmed by thirty different serums and zero real guidance, still didn't know what your skin needed.</p>\n    <p class=\"nur-about__lead\">Nur Skincoach is what happens when I stopped building that intelligence for brands, and built it for you instead.</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"nur-about__cta\">\n    <h2 class=\"nur-about__cta-title\">The same AI thinking<br><em>now built into your mask</em></h2>\n    <a href=\"/products/nur-protocol\" class=\"nur-about__cta-link\">Shop Nur Protocol <span>&rarr;</span></a>\n  </section>\n\n</div>\n",
        "color_scheme": "",
        "section_width": "full-width",
        "padding-block-start": 0,
        "padding-block-end": 0
      }
    }
